  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">International Conference on Future Agenda of Action for Global Diaspora Engagement: Launch of Global Diaspora Policy Alliance (GDPA)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The &#x201C;International Conference on the Future Agenda of Action for Global Diaspora Engagement&#x201D; is to bring together the supporters of the Dublin Declaration to glean insights from leading-edge practices in diaspora engagement. Additionally, the conference seeks to inaugurate the Global Diaspora Policy Alliance (GDPA). This alliance is envisioned as a pivotal foundation for crafting the future roadmap of global diaspora engagement initiatives.</narrative>
  </description>
